#' formula \code{min(6, 3 + (lenshort - 5) %/% 2)} (\code{ALIGN_CDR3S =
#' FALSE}).
#'
#' BSD4 values are compiled in as \code{constexpr} (no matrix argument
#' needed).  The result is numerically identical to
