#' @param gap_penalty_cdr3_region Integer. Per-residue length-difference penalty.
#'   Default 12 matches \code{GAP_PENALTY_CDR3_REGION}.
#' @return Numeric scalar: the weighted CDR3 distance.
#' @examples
